  dialogueResponses: []
  entryDialogues:
  - "Evening. I need to get back inside. The soil out there isn\u2019t right anymore."
  - "You can check whatever you need. I\u2019ve been outside long enough\u2026 longer
    than I should have."
  - "I brought samples, but they won\u2019t last. Things decay faster now. Even when
    they shouldn\u2019t."
  anomalyEntryDialogues:
  - "Evening. I was just\u2026 outside. The plants don\u2019t react to light the
    same way anymore. They lean toward something else."
  - "You can check the papers. Everything should match. It did before\u2026 it always
    does eventually."
  - "I shouldn\u2019t have stayed out that long. The air felt\u2026 thick. Like it
    was settling into me."
